Training-data attribution (ODC-By / original licenses)
------------------------------------------------------

ArzLM-300M-Base was pretrained on packed text from:

* HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu (config sample-10BT) — ODC-By-1.0;
  crawled pages remain subject to the Common Crawl Terms of Use.
* HuggingFaceTB/finemath (config finemath-4plus) — ODC-By-1.0;
  crawled pages remain subject to the Common Crawl Terms of Use.
* HuggingFaceTB/smollm-corpus cosmopedia-v2 — dataset card license ODC-By;
  Cosmopedia-v2 is Mixtral-generated textbooks seeded from web pages.
* HuggingFaceTB/stack-edu — Software Heritage blobs under the original
  FOSS licenses of each file. This run kept the permissive-license subset
  recorded in data/security/source-lock-6b.json.
* allenai/peS2o v2 — ODC-By (corpus). Paper copyrights remain with authors.

ODC-By requires attribution of the database. This NOTICE is that
attribution. Model weights are a trained artifact, not a redistribution
of the raw corpora.

Nemotron-CC-Math was considered and rejected because the NVIDIA Data
Agreement does not permit this release model.
